Description: Wizard to create a customized Ubuntu Live CD image.
 Cubic (Custom Ubuntu ISO Creator) is a GUI wizard to create a customized
 bootable Ubuntu Live CD ISO image. Cubic features an integrated command line
 virtual environment to make the customizations and permits effortless
 navigation, backward and forward, through the ISO generation steps. You can
 create new customization projects or modify existing projects. Important
 parameters are automatically populated with intelligent defaults to simplify
 the customization process.
